{"id": "carmichael", "titulo": "Amy Carmichael · Amma, the mother of Dohnavur", "inicio": "c1", "revelar": true, "escenas": [{"id": "c1", "titulo": "Millisle, Ireland", "fondo": "img/fondos/carmichael/cuarto_nina.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e001", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/amy_nina/amy_nina.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Amy", "x": 420, "y": 535, "w": 281, "h": 440, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e002", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/madre_amy/madre_amy.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Mother", "x": 856, "y": 305, "w": 448, "h": 670, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l003", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Ireland, 1867. In the village of Millisle, Amy Carmichael was born, the eldest of seven children.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l004", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Her family loved God, and Amy learned to love Jesus from a young age.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l005", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Amy, Jesus loves you and always takes care of you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e002"}, {"id": "l006", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I want to love him all my life too!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/amy_nina/amy_nina_feliz.webp", "quien": "e001"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "c2"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "c2", "titulo": "Belfast", "fondo": "img/fondos/carmichael/belfast_calle.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e007", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/amy/amy.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Amy", "x": 313, "y": 295, "w": 414, "h": 680, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e008", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/molinera/molinera.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Mill girl", "x": 886, "y": 335, "w": 428, "h": 640, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l009", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "When Amy was 16, her family moved to Belfast. There, many poor girls worked in the mills.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l010", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Would you like to come to a Bible class on Sundays?", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e007"}, {"id": "l011", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "A class for us, the mill girls?", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e008"}, {"id": "c016", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does Amy answer?", "opciones": [{"id": "o013", "texto": "You’d better find another church", "lineas": [{"id": "l012", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Amy did not think that way: she wanted those girls to know Jesus.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o015", "texto": "Yes, for you! God loves you", "lineas": [{"id": "l014", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Yes, for you! God loves you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/amy/amy_decidida.webp", "quien": "e007"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}, {"id": "l017", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "It began with a Sunday class. In 1887 the “Welcome Hall” opened, a hall to welcome them.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "c3"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "c3", "titulo": "The call", "fondo": "img/fondos/carmichael/salon_bienvenida.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e018", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/amy/amy_decidida.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Amy", "x": 578, "y": 285, "w": 443, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l019", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "That same year, at a gathering of believers in Keswick, Amy heard Hudson Taylor, a missionary to China.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l020", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "From then on she felt that God was calling her to take the gospel to other countries.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "c025", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does Amy do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o022", "texto": "Stay where everything is familiar", "lineas": [{"id": "l021", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "It would have been easier… but Amy knew God was calling her.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o024", "texto": "Obey and go", "lineas": [{"id": "l023", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I will go wherever God sends me.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e018"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}, {"id": "l026", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "First she went to Japan. Then, in 1895, she left for India. She never went back to Ireland.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "c4"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "c4", "titulo": "India, 1901", "fondo": "img/fondos/carmichael/iglesia_noche.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e027", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/amy_sari/amy_sari.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Amy", "x": 250, "y": 285, "w": 460, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e028", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/preena/preena_miedo.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Preena", "x": 979, "y": 525, "w": 282, "h": 450, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l029", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In southern India, Amy and her co-workers dressed like the women there.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l030", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In that region, some girls were given away to the temples to serve there, far from their families, and they suffered greatly.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l031", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In March 1901, a 7-year-old girl named Preena escaped from a temple and came to a church at night. The next day she was brought to Amy.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l032", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Are you going to send me back to the temple?", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e028"}, {"id": "c038", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does Amy do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o034", "texto": "Send her back to avoid trouble", "lineas": [{"id": "l033", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "No. Jesus said, “Let the little children come to Me.”", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/amy_sari/amy_sari_preocupada.webp", "quien": "e027"}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o037", "texto": "Take her in and care for her", "lineas": [{"id": "l035", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "You’re safe here, little one.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/amy_sari/amy_sari_feliz.webp", "quien": "e027"}, {"id": "l036", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Amma!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "img/personajes/preena/preena_feliz.webp", "quien": "e028"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}, {"id": "l039", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Preena called her “Amma,” which means “mother.”", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "c5"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "c5", "titulo": "Dohnavur", "fondo": "img/fondos/carmichael/dohnavur.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e040", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/amy_sari/amy_sari_feliz.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Amy", "x": 330, "y": 285, "w": 459, "h": 690, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e041", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/preena/preena_feliz.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Preena", "x": 902, "y": 525, "w": 295, "h": 450, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l042", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "After Preena came many more girls. By 1913 there were more than 130, and from 1918 there was a home for boys too.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l043", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "At Dohnavur, Amy and her co-workers made a big family. More than a thousand children found a home there.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l044", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“Let the little children come to Me, and do not hinder them! For the kingdom of heaven belongs to such as these.” (Matthew 19:14 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "c6"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "c6", "titulo": "The last years", "fondo": "img/fondos/carmichael/cuarto_amy.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e045", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/amy_mayor/amy_mayor.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Amy", "x": 563, "y": 375, "w": 394, "h": 600, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l046", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1931 Amy had a fall that kept her mostly in bed for the last 20 years of her life.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l047", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "But she kept serving God: in those years she wrote many books.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l048", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Amy died in Dohnavur in 1951, aged 83, without ever going back to Ireland.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "fin", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": null}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]}